  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_297680_(Neo-)Forge.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_585782_Fabric.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fadditional-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/additional-structures?logo=modrinth&label=&suffix= &style=flat&color=242629&labelColor=5ca424&logoColor=1c1c1c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/297680(266fff).svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Supported Versions\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/ycRJJk8EXV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/523112426913267713?color=282828&logo=discord&style=flat&label=&labelColor=B6BCEA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Additional-Structures/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"500\"><br><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line_curved.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p>\n<h2>📖 Описание</h2>\n<p>Этот мод добавляет в игру около 250 новых малых и средних структур, чтобы расширить ваш мир!</p>\n<ul>\n<li>поддержит моды на генерацию биомов, такие как Terralith, Traverse, Biomes O' Plenty, Biome Bundle и другие!</li>\n<li>работает с командой /locate</li>\n<li>встроенная проверка обновлений</li>\n<li>различные структуры генерируются в ванильных и модифицированных биомах в Верхнем мире и Энде!</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures/pages/config-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Конфигурационный датапак</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Хотите изменить или настроить параметры некоторых структур в версии 1.18+? <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures/pages/config-datapack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Вот как это сделать!</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures/pages/structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Здесь вы можете найти все структуры текущей версии</a>!</p>\n<p>Вы используете (Neo-)Forge? Тогда используйте <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">эту версию</a>!</p>\n<p><br><br><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p>\n<h2>📷 Презентация</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HJ3k534.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BcQcqeI.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mYWKb79.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/U20qUIY.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kqG38d8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wDwNNl4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZuLeZyF.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Eevyyo9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aIJVHLA.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7KLxZrl.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8YVKUi0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bbZ7yxe.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sGMDPw4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ta7WuIM.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p>\n<h2>🗃️ Зависимости</h2>\n<h3>Поддерживаются:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Antique Atlas</strong> [&ge; MC 1.21]\n<ul>\n<li>Маркер карты для некоторых структур на карте</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/antique-atlas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fantique-atlas-4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p>\n<h2>🎮 Мои другие моды!</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Additional-Structures/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Additional Structures\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bedrock-miner\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Bedrock-Miner/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Bedrock Miner\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tool-upgrades\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ToolUpgrades/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Tool Upgrades\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-the-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AllTheCompatibility/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"All The Compatibility\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customized-dungeon-loot\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/2291f5f13114f09294ce5e079f8a61b8a2617a8692e68ca453674e93f1982b62/687474703a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f427065525748442e706e67\" alt=\"Customized Dungeon Loot\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-sticks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AdvancedSticks/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=tr